  {
   "id": "dreaming-sarah-8702@1.2",
   "gameId": "dreaming-sarah-8702",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2016-08-09T05:09:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As I've mentioned before, I was holding out on an update until some issues with the program I use were fixed. A new version came out this week and I could fix most bugs and give better support for OSX/Linux users.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here's a changelog for version 1.2",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed most menu/item bugs/crashes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bug where talking to certain NPCs would lock Sarah in place",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed music related bugs when using the pill",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed statistics timer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some sounds not being played at the right volume",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed fish related bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bartender bug",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bug where using the magnifying glass and entering the mansion would make Sarah disappear",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Linux) - fixed fullscreen mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "(OSX) - fixed crash with red text when loading game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please keep in mind that some other bugs still may occur. Let me know in the bug thread and I'll take a look! Also, as I've mentioned before, I don't actually own a Mac and I don't use Linux a lot, but I've managed to test the game on a Virtual Machine to at least make sure it would open up and work. If you find out anything wrong with these versions, let me know.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, I cannot thank enough for all your help when reporting bugs. Everyone who reported anything they could find helped me a LOT.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
